{
  "file" : "npc/re/jobs/3-2/sorcerer.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "You packed so much in your bag. Try again after emptying your bag."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Please get on with the sprits well~ You should~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Wow~ you are a young adventurer. I envy you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Ahh~ I think you don't need to have a conversation with me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Welcome. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Do you know about Sorcerers?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Wouldn't it be more comfortable to just live as a scholar? Sorcerers are busy communicating with the spirits and don't have much time to read books..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "What made you want to be a sorcerer?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "The spirit of fire led me here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "The spirit of water led me here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "The spirit of earth led me here"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "The spirit of meat led me here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "That kind of spirit doesn't exist!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Oh, I see."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "You must be born with the natural ability to see that you already communicated with the spirits, or you must be an excellent liar."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Hmm... Then first, can you write down your name on this list?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Write name."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "I won't."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Well, okay. See you again when you get a chance."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "So, you are [{0}]."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Give me a second to register your name."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Talk to me again in a second."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Good, then I'll give you a short explanation about the Sorcerer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "[{0}], can you handle magic skillfully?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Yes, I can."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "No, I'm not really good at it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "What!? You don't know how to use magic?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "What are you doing here then? Get out of here. Right now!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Okay, that should be obvious."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Of course, Sorcerers use magic, too. But, do you know the main difference Sorcerers have from other magical jobs?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "They know how to sing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "They're all old fogies."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "They can deal with the spirits."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Well maybe some but that's not the main difference."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "What! How dare you!?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "That's right. That is the most distinguishing feature that Sorcerers have."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "When the people who want to be a Sorcerer come, the first thing we do is to check whether they can communicate with spirits or not."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "So that's the basic introduction, so you just need to decide whether or not you want to take the qualification test."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Well, it's all up to you. What are you going to do?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "I will take the test."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "I'll do it later."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Okay. "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "Then I'll hand it over to Karacas who is on the 4th floor. He will guide you through the process of the test."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "[Merito]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "What? I was sure that you wanted to become a Sorcerer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "text" : "How about your test? Well, Karacas is a little lazy, so that might bother you some... kkk"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Oh, it seems that you're too heavy. Empty your bag and then come again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "You look happy. Have a great journey."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Is there anything I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "I belong to the Sorcerer association. I don't think you have any business with me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "More people are visiting Geffen Tower these days."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Ah... excuse me~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "... (Z z z~)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Hm hm!!!~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Aaaak!! "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Oh, my... "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Wh... where are you from?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Merito told me to visit you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "I see, give me a moment."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "The list... has already arrived."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "text" : "So, you are [{0}]... right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Yes, I am."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "No, I'm not!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Oh, there must be some mistake in the list, I think. Will you come again later?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Before you take the Sorcerer test, let me give you the basic information."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "The way to get a Sorcerer registration ticket is really simple. You just need to go and find one of each spirit scattered around the world, and then convert their power into the shape of a certain material."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Sounds easy, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Ahh... sir. Is that really possible?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Well, it is impossible to meet every spirit by yourself. You need to train yourself very hard to give a shape to the spirits and see them clearly through your eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "So, usually we perform a certain ceremony parade toward the place where we can feel the spirits."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "I will tell you how to do that. So listen carefully."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Usually we cannot see the spirits with our eyes but there is a way to realize the part of the spirits through a special medium."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "For example, if you visit the place where the spirit of wind stays with a certain amount of Wind of Verdure, the reaction of the spirit is amplified."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Likewise, if you approach the place where the spirit of fire seems to stay while you have a certain amount of Red Blood, the spirit will show the adverse reaction."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Sorcerers use this basic principle, this is the essential knowledge that Sorcerers need to have to reach the spirits."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "So communicating with spirits..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Right~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "This job is based on the power of spirits."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Hmm, but it might be hard for someone like you who's focused only on reading books..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "First, you need to bring the following materials needed for the test."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "3 Wind of Verdure."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "3 Crystal Blue."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "3 Red Blood."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "3 Green Live."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "When you bring these materials, I'll tell you the next step."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Oh, you have all the materials."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "What should I do next?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "I'll tell you about it now. First, I'll tell you the places for the test. You better write them down."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "1. 1st floor of Ice Cave"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "2. 1st floor of Thor Volcano Dungeon"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 250,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "3. 3rd floor of Mjolnir Dead Pit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "4. 2nd floor of Kunlun Dungeon"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "We have set up the detecting poles in these 4 places so that ordinary people can communicate with the spirits."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Be aware that these detecting poles are activated only when you have more than the certain amount of property stones."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "You need to prepare at least 3 small stones for each property. For example, you need Wind of Verdure, not Rough Wind."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "So I need the property stones..."
