      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Once you bring the stones to the poles, put them into the property decomposing machine which is attached to the pole. The detecting pole will be activated, and you can communicate with the spirit."
