      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "If you succeed, you can extract a part of the spirit as a reagent. If you fail, the property stone will break up."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Of course if you are lucky enough, if you fail, a Wind of Verdure can be changed into a Rough Wind... Well, that's not a common situation so let's leave that out of the discussion for now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 275,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "What if I run out of stones?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "Ahahaha... If you run out of property stones, you simply have to get more."
