      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 280,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "So people who have this test usually start with as many property stones as they can carry. The amount I told you to get is just the bare minimum."
