      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 282,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "If you are an advanced Sorcerer, you will be able to talk with spirits without going through this process again. But beginners need to use that kind of medium to talk with them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "So the reagent is...?"
