      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "[Karacas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "text" : "We don't know which reagent is going to be made from the spirits. It differs by the state of spirits."
